  <item>
    <title>42. 超马越野跑装备考·其一</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653fcbb85250ea2baa57e76d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653fcbb85250ea2baa57e76d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>两位超马越野跑者分享越野跑配装思路和装备推荐。这一期涵盖了“穿”的越野跑装备，希望为大家双十一和年底进货提供思路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的顺序是从上到下，由内而外，不仅告诉你我们用的是什么，更重要的是我们怎么选！</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案里提到的装备是举例参考，不是折扣链接！用我们的思路你可以在各种购物平台上找到适合自己的平替。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>帽子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>HOKA五片帽 </span><a href="https://www.hoka.com/en/us/all-gender-apparel/performance-hat/1117092.html?dwvar_1117092_color=CGLW" data-url="https://www.hoka.com/en/us/all-gender-apparel/performance-hat/1117092.html?dwvar_1117092_color=CGLW"><span>www.hoka.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Ciele </span><a href="https://cieleathletics.com/collections/caps?sort_by=created-descending&amp;filter.p.m.custom.style=GOCap&amp;filter.v.price.gte=&amp;filter.v.price.lte=" data-url="https://cieleathletics.com/collections/caps?sort_by=created-descending&amp;filter.p.m.custom.style=GOCap&amp;filter.v.price.gte=&amp;filter.v.price.lte="><span>cieleathletics.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Patagonia </span><a href="https://www.patagonia.com/product/airshed-lightweight-cap/195699582576.html" data-url="https://www.patagonia.com/product/airshed-lightweight-cap/195699582576.html"><span>www.patagonia.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>发带</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Icebreaker </span><a href="https://www.icebreaker.com/en-us/hats-neckwear/cool-lite-merino-flexi-headband/0A56FN016OS.html?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=18039933080&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwnOipBhBQEiwACyGLuqxSBP_qLjkn0-l2GZju7v78SR6ZtQX2OVS2-LJfPtgVJSZsvec20RoCkicQAvD_BwE" data-url="https://www.icebreaker.com/en-us/hats-neckwear/cool-lite-merino-flexi-headband/0A56FN016OS.html?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=18039933080&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwnOipBhBQEiwACyGLuqxSBP_qLjkn0-l2GZju7v78SR6ZtQX2OVS2-LJfPtgVJSZsvec20RoCkicQAvD_BwE"><span>www.icebreaker.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>头套</s